WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.902
&gt;&gt; YOU DO KNOW LITTLE GIRLS CAN
GO AS FAR AS THEIR IMAGINATIONS

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:06.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
WILL TAKE THEM.
LIKE OUTER SPACE.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:10.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; LIFTOFF!
&gt;&gt; THE STREETS OF PARIS?

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.177
BONJOUR.
OR A MAGICAL WORLD THEY CREATED

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:12.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
ALL ON THEIR OWN?
&gt;&gt; THIS IS HOW YOU GET TO THE

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:20.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
CASTLE.
&gt;&gt; AND TO SHOW JUST HOW FAR WE

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
MATTEL IS PROUD TO
INTRODUCE PRESIDENT'S BARBIE,

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:25.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
THE FIRST BARBIE
COMMANDER-IN-CHIEF.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:29.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, NEAT.
&gt;&gt; OH, DON'T YOU WANT TO PLAY

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
WITH HER.
SHE'S A GIRL.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.266
JUST LIKE YOU.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, BUT GIRLS DON'T HAVE TO

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:36.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
PLAY WITH DOLLS.
WE CAN PLAY WITH WHATEVER WE

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:37.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
WANT.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S TRUE.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:38.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU DIDN'T HAVE TO PLAY WITH
DOLLS.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.540
BUT IT WOULD BE GREAT IF YOU
PLAYED WITH THIS DOLL RIGHT NOW.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I LIKE LEGOS.
&gt;&gt; I LIKE LEGOS.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:49.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S WHAT YOU SOUND LIKE.
&gt;&gt; LOOK --

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.483
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT BARBIE COMES WITH
ACCESSORIES LIKE SUNGLASSES AND

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
SMART PHONE WITH SNAPCHAT.
DO YOU LIKE HER NOW?

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
HUH?
DO YOU?

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:56.156
&gt;&gt; LOOKS LIKE SHE IS TRYING TOO
HARD.

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:58.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SHE IS TRYING HARD.
BECAUSE

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
THERE USED TO BE A TIME WHEN
BARBIE COULDN'T EVEN BE

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
PRESIDENT.
&gt;&gt; I WASN'T ALIVE THEN.

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:06.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; GOOD FOR YOU.
&gt;&gt; I JUST DON'T LIKE HER.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
SHE IS TOO STIFF.
&gt;&gt; I BET YOU WOULD LIKE

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
PRESIDENT BARBIE IF SHE SMILED
MORE TOO?

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.605
&gt;&gt; YEAH.
&gt;&gt; WOW, YOU REALLY DON'T GET IT,

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:17.577
DO YOU?
&gt;&gt; HEY, DO YOU KNOW WHAT WILL BE

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:18.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
FUN?
IF WE

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.179
PLAYED WITH THAT OLD BROOM OVER
THERE.

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:23.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YEAH!
&gt;&gt; THAT'S WHAT THEY GO WITH.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:24.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
UH --
WE NEED TO RETHINK THIS WHOLE

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:27.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
THING.
&gt;&gt; HEY, GIRLS, WHY DON'T YOU

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:31.391
PLAY WITH PRESIDENT BARBIE?
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE WE DON'T HAVE TO!

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:34.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH.
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT BARBIE, NO FUN,

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:37.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
DEFINITELY A PRESIDENT.
[ APPLAUSE ]

